{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a912afc2eb291620","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8008\n3\tepic_count: 3\n4\tcritical_path_length: 3\n5\tdecompose_complete: true\n6\ttriage: null\n7\ttriage_rationale: null\n8\t---\n9\t# Decomposition Summary: RHAISTRAT-8008\n10\t\n11\tInference-Aware Autoscaling for llm-d — standalone KEDA primitives for LLMInferenceService.\n12\t\n13\tStaff Engineer / SME Input section is empty (template placeholder only) — no overrides to apply.\n14\t\n15\t## Epic List\n16\t\n17\t| ID | Title | Type | Team | Priority |\n18\t|----|-------|------|------|----------|\n19\t| RHAISTRAT-8008-E001 | Standalone KEDA autoscaling path for LLMInferenceService in kserve llmisvc-controller | Implementation | Serving team | P0 |\n20\t| RHAISTRAT-8008-E002 | KEDA TriggerAuthentication reconciler for LLMInferenceService in odh-model-controller | Implementation | Serving team | P0 |\n21\t| RHAISTRAT-8008-E003 | Autoscaling decision guide and configuration documentation for LLMInferenceService | Implementation (docs-authoring) | Documentation team | P0 |\n22\t\n23\t## Dependency DAG\n24\t\n25\t```mermaid\n26\tgraph TD\n27\t    E001[RHAISTRAT-8008-E001 Standalone KEDA path in llmisvc-controller]\n28\t    E002[RHAISTRAT-8008-E002 TriggerAuthentication reconciler in odh-model-controller]\n29\t    E003[RHAISTRAT-8008-E003 Autoscaling documentation]\n30\t    E001 --> E002\n31\t    E001 --> E003\n32\t    E002 --> E003\n33\t```\n34\t\n35\tCritical path: E001 → E002 → E003 (length 3).\n36\t\n37\t## DAG Justification\n38\t\n39\t| Edge | Rule | Rationale |\n40\t|------|------|-----------|\n41\t| E001 → E002 | Rule 13 (build-against artifact) | E001 lands the standalone KEDA spec in the LLMInferenceService v1alpha2 API (ScalingSpec `keda` field, CEL validation). The odh-model-controller reconciler's code builds against those API types and reconciles CRs carrying the new fields — a build-against